WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.490
Built around your drawer. A source-led assembly concept • E910BP

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.490
Every part has a purpose. Pre-installed hardware is shown in place. Green nylon connectors; metallic spring pins.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:14.490
Bring the side joints together. Align all connections together before seating the frame.

4
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.490
Add the bottom support. Align the support hardware with the rear receiving locations.

5
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.490
Slide the bottom into its grooves. Keep the bottom level as it enters the side grooves.

6
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.490
Connect the finished front. Align the H-clips and spring pins, then seat the front evenly.

7
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.490
Ready for the next connection. Explore this drawer style with Lockdowel.
